</style><script type="text/javascript" async="" src="./Mk14_files/js" nonce=""></script><!--<base href="https://gemini.google.com/">--><base href="."><link rel="preconnect" href="https://www.gstatic.com/"><meta name="referrer" content="origin"><meta name="viewport" content="initial-scale=1,minimum-scale=1,width=device-width,interactive-widget=resizes-content,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="color-scheme" content="only"><meta name="google-site-verification" content="NDfDvTdbFxsd1TbRRZVQZULBTRT2-fatyuQ1TT8gack"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Gemini"><meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"><meta name="application-name" content="Gemini"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Gemini"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black"><meta name="msapplication-tap-highlight" content="no"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://gemini.gstatic.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://www.google.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://waa-pa.clients6.google.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://ogads-pa.clients6.google.com/"><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://www.gstatic.com/"><link rel="manifest" crossorigin="use-credentials" href="https://gemini.google.com/_/BardChatUi/manifest.json"><link rel="home" href="https://gemini.google.com/?lfhs=2"><link rel="msapplication-starturl" href="https://gemini.google.com/?lfhs=2"><link rel="icon" href="https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/gemini_sparkle_4g_512_lt_f94943af3be039176192d.png" sizes="512x512"><link rel="apple-touch-icon-precomposed" href="https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/gemini_sparkle_4g_512_lt_f94943af3be039176192d.png" sizes="512x512"><link rel="msapplication-square512x512logo" href="https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/gemini_sparkle_4g_512_lt_f94943af3be039176192d.png" sizes="512x512"><link rel="preload" href="./Mk14_files/m=_b" as="script" nonce=""><script data-id="_gd" nonce="">window.WIZ_global_data = {"AEJOSc":false,"ARR9x":true,"AfY8Hf":false,"Ajsvkd":true,"B7TsWc":"","BdA8rf":true,"CVUPx":false,"DEh2U":false,"DedwT":true,"Di4zjc":false,"DnVkpd":"Help me pack for a weekend camping trip. We’re bringing our labradoodle, fishing for salmon, and planning to stargaze.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/en/d1_31d908884d72319540103.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/en/da1_b357750635e4585280725.png∞Here is a list of camping gear essentials that you may need for your weekend camping trip:\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTent:\u003c/strong\u003e This is where you will sleep, so make sure it is big enough for everyone and that it is in good condition.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSleeping bags:\u003c/strong\u003e These will keep you warm at night. Choose sleeping bags that are rated for the temperature range you will be camping in.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSleeping pads:\u003c/strong\u003e These will add extra insulation and comfort to your sleeping bags.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCamp chairs:\u003c/strong\u003e These will be a lifesaver when you are relaxing around the campfire or just taking a break from hiking\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e∰Rewrite this email draft to make it more clear and concise∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/en/d2_63e667d15464db3e96f2e.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/en/da2_2ff53d7c4782d54272f15.png∞Sure, here is a more clear and concise version of your email draft:\u003cbr /\u003eDear Professor [Professor’s name],\u003cbr /\u003eCongratulations on your Teaching Excellence Award! I am so honored to have had you as my economics professor this semester.\u003cbr /\u003eYour engaging teaching style has made complex economic concepts easy to understand. I especially appreciated how you incorporated real-world examples into your lectures. Your helpfulness and support both in and out of the classroom has been invaluable.∰Give me a list of 5 well-known sci-fi books and show the results in a table with descriptions∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/en/d3_e479902e2fe272b199c8a.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/i18n/en/da3_9dab65cbc90ef9e98f389.png∞Sure, here is a list of 5 well-known sci-fi books in a table with descriptions, including images:\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth\u003eBook\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eAuthor\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eYear\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eDescription\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e","DpimGf":false,"ENrkEf":0,"EOzIkf":"UMwOLzU_6bA","EP1ykd":["/_/*","/calling-opt-out","/calling-opt-out/*","/corp","/corp/*","/drivesharing","/drivesharing/*","/emulator","/emulator/*","/staging","/staging/*"],"FABJ3e":"https://docs.google.com/picker","FL1an":false,"FdrFJe":"1691875120109740416","GK6dn":"https://geminiweb-pa.clients6.google.com","GdU5Bf":"","GruApd":"mf1.ASl0kTktAqU1HVIrCAPBJuaLCAwo6xdFCVhm0gHFCkJprhiXClm2Pof9C_rMnkavDRtlEooED07qDRngEHlCb892EbJ2Wi_nEs-wt9JnEwe63gNIE2GexEfcFmfwxBElGHTQ7DB-GokVqmNVG0XgYdfNHes4thHcHhltYtLVIH7yR75EIJ530oE7JH5uGu1pJWDCBVDUJxTsx6zRLOKZOUs9L0nYo456MDMgi47FMwHkmRJPM6sh0ab1NHoU-TFiPEv8exhlPFX-YCk1PLurRyyZPXB8Pe9ZQE468CKeQXjNdHuhQkX4hs9GQ7-Deqk2RnzA3k81R6QVsbiWR7FHcXWQSMB4CDgUSnn-EAqhSsb-wekzUCf7aQdRWIHsPY_aW7K92FNYXVQqokOEXqTW8tlFXwJ5MsQ8YkGngvnjYr7z8L40Y2uAz3xcZt_EuE4yZ36kVzFWZ4wywYiDZ_bFZSKDbG99pkzzbcarFAa7cDB8Rve2crPH2yIxcxQKSBb6dElsGC37dWkuv_c5eIDPTRcDe4VR0MkSfVy3vVDagLDhUTXig9LKSLOMhC80LES_jCGyK5NFj0BPwD64j9RA9BumkSV1LYpnkTj5xnV7kUKHX9bskebnwAcQlciudj6qma4ne4WAmcuDPqy5mnl3qg2KnD5JCvOSnKKgSvMqnWQohR-0nfeF3eU4n9r0JoJzohUQJtLNoxD6yhiwo4ApizZjpmFlUTXtqAKJ50CoqjpQlVVmrXhY66omsUlTchjasVoCgOfsuYiat-WVugrZiAR2ujle5_0LvZn2GDvVxA87PB78xIomzSt_xu6OBeFeybnkV81Wy8g_MwfpzSiqxOHczaFQ9fzuzqvBDkIS0pgCEqvK1CA0vNUo1Pwczsaq1qP54FLs2rJ5qSvy2wIBO3Fr27hvmID-3Ck-zZ5D3WWS-NwG3bpPN3q-3_MKYFJo3_fYCqIX4Ly0arTH4S1fr-TB4_IEv7yI5fP4DNv16iHzG2um7byn2yvp75C_tah98zIVqFMc9C_9DSvS9fxDgBui9saDAWN--_39qHXJ_m8fCbCZ","GtQXDc":"Give me caption options to tell the world about my new fur baby, Finn. Use emojis∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/m1_02050367fdbe8690faba4.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/ma1_21f7d57cc2164a94180f6.png∞Sure, here are some caption options to tell the world about your new fur baby, Finn, using emojis:\n🐶 Meet my new best friend, Finn! He’s a bundle of joy and I can’t wait for all the adventures we’ll have together. #newpuppy #furryfriend #Finn\n🐾 Finn has stolen my heart! He’s the cutest and cuddliest puppy I’ve ever met. #puppylove #FinnFan #doglover\n🐕‍🦺 Finn is officially part of the family! He’s already brought so much joy into our lives. #welcomehomeFinn #adoptdontshop #dogsofinstagram\n🐶 Finn is my little shadow! He follows me everywhere I go. #puptastic #FinnAdventures #dogdays\n🐾 Finn is always up for a good cuddle! He’s the perfect lapdog. #snugglebuddy #FinnTheCuddleBug #bestdoggoever∰Describe a new fashion trend that’s inspired by retro styles.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/m2_0837b565aa77b98938d28.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/ma2_4dc50c5a1ccf43229c150.png∞New fashion trend inspired by retro styles:\nThe Neo-Glam Revival\nThe Neo-Glam Revival is a new fashion trend that takes inspiration from the glamorous styles of the 1970s and 1980s. This trend is all about bold colors, metallics, and over-the-top silhouettes.\nSome of the key pieces of the Neo-Glam Revival include:\nSequin dresses: Sequin dresses are a must-have for anyone who wants to channel the Neo-Glam Revival trend. These dresses are perfect for a night out on the town, and they’ll make you feel like a million bucks.\nMetallic suits: Metallic suits are another key piece of the Neo-Glam Revival trend. These suits are perfect for making a statement, and they can be dressed up or down depending on the occasion.∰Draft a guide on how to set up the perfect movie marathon night with friends.∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/m3_d4e89a863f2a97bd080a7.jpg∞https://www.gstatic.com/lamda/images/landing/a/u18/en/ma3_45eebba09a87a8a8c95e6.png∞How to Set Up the Perfect Movie Marathon Night with Friends\nMovie marathons are a great way to spend time with friends and enjoy your favorite films. But to make sure your marathon is a success, there are a few things you need to do to prepare.\n1. Choose your movies\nThe most important thing is to choose movies that everyone will enjoy. If you’re not sure what to pick, try doing a poll of your friends to see what they’re interested in. You can also choose a theme for your marathon, such as all comedies, all horror movies, or all movies from a particular decade.\n2. Set a schedule\nOnce you’ve chosen your movies, it’s a good idea to set a schedule for the night. This will help ensure that you have enough time to watch all of the movies and also take breaks for snacks and bathroom visits.","HUGLxb":"https://geminiweb-pa.clients6.google.com","HiPsbb":1,"I2uq4c":"","Im6cmf":"/_/BardChatUi","IrULFb":"","J1jtEd":5,"JLbhgf":"https://notebooklm.google.com","JNl6me":"/punctual/prod/assistant-bard","KnDnFf":"feeds/nrij2vo2gajxiu","L8cmRe":" ","LoQv7e":false,"LtiLwc":true,"Lz8rbb":true,"ML1cTc":true,"MT7f9b":[],"MUE6Ne":"gemini-web-uiserver","MuJWjd":false,"P1qjVc":false,"PI9WOb":"CAMSjwcVjQDM2swNqASxpNAF9im9BK8C4AaMBZMDoA-DBJEG7QbADmk9-_P9DrivBSNLAdeRBsjDBryBBs8g6wLzDsEUqIkE9QYDy6y-F5DF_gPSDqoGtgIEl4QEsWjhLL6ABYPQ3Aam_AQ-sDH4QL5LiwXTogaFpwb-LaAC5aMFQu9OtAWisAbk8wWx1Q2Vfdwa2poGlwXPVZZbjm0D2GenVPYJ-Y4Fo1E6qFmmBserBZw-jE