11"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c2236698117="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_144599af7a026c58" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_144599af7a026c58" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">J'ai mis à jour </span><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="16">les trois fichiers</b><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="36">index.html</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="48">style.css</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="61">script.js</code><span>) afin de respecter toutes vos demandes :</span></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Magasin (<code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="9">MAGASIN</code>)</b><span> :</span><span> chaque arme s'affiche dans un rectangle avec son </span><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="69">image</b><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="76">image_c93845.png</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="94">image_c938c2.png</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="112">image_c93bc8.png</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="130">image_c93c2b.png</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="148">image_c93fad.jpg</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="166">image_c99201.jpg</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="184">image_c99ddc.jpg</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="202">image_c9a941.jpg</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="220">image_c9b084.jpg</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="238">image_c9b3af.jpg</code><span>),</span><span> son </span><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="261">prix en bas</b><span>,</span><span> et </span><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="277">à droite</b><span> ses statistiques (</span><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="304">munitions</b><span>,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="315">temps de rechargement</b><span>,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="338">vitesse de tir</b><span> et </span><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="356">dégâts par distance de tir</b><span>),</span><span> plus l'affichage de l'argent directement dans l'en-tête du magasin.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Bouton / cases Jouer (<code data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="22">JOUER</code>)</b><span> :</span><span> les cases de difficulté sont légèrement agrandies (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="82">padding</code><span>,</span><span> hauteur et typographie) tout en conservant le style.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Améliorations (<code data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="15">AMÉLIORATIONS</code>)</b><span> :</span><span> affichage des armes possédées avec l'image,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="76">sans le prix en bas</b><span>,</span><span> uniquement les statistiques à droite,</span><span> l'argent visible en haut,</span><span> et </span><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="164">au clic sur une arme</b><span>,</span><span> deux panneaux apparaissent :</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="215">à gauche</b><span> les statistiques actuelles et </span><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="254">à droite</b><span class=""> les statistiques au niveau suivant (aperçu immédiat même avant d'acheter l'amélioration).</span></p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="3" class=""><code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">index.html</code></h3><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 673ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-12 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-12 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8xNDQ1OTlh