header ng-tns-c1361134428-17 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c1361134428-17"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="ng-tns-c1361134428-17 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c1361134428-17"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c1361134428-17"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c1361134428-17"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c1361134428-17" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c1361134428-17"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1361134428-17"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c2236698117="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_eb265b308c77f225" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_eb265b308c77f225" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0" class="">Oui, exactement.</b><span> Mettez toutes les images des armes (</span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="53">image_c93845.png</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="71">image_c938c2.png</code><span>,</span><span> etc.</span><span>) </span><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="95">dans le même dossier</b><span> que </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="120">Garage_2.jpg</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="136">edited-image.jpg</code><span> (à côté de </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="164">index.html</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="176">style.css</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="189">script.js</code><span>).</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><span>Dans le </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="8">script.js</code><span> actuel,</span><span> les chemins sont écrits directement avec le nom du fichier (par exemple </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="98">"image_c93845.png"</code><span>),</span><span> tout comme </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="130">"Garage_2.jpg"</code><span> dans le </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="153">style.css</code><span> :</span><span> le navigateur cherchera donc automatiquement ces images dans ce même dossier.</span></p><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2">Comment vérifier que tout est bien en place</h3><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Regroupez les fichiers :</b><span> Placez </span><code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="32">index.html</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="44">style.css</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="55">script.js</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="66">Garage_2.jpg</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="80">edited-image.jpg</code><span> et toutes les images d'armes dans le même dossier.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vérifiez les noms exacts :</b><span> Assurez-vous que le nom de chaque fichier image dans le dossier correspond exactement à celui écrit dans </span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="132">script.js</code><span> (attention aux majuscules et à l'extension </span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="185">.png</code><span> ou </span><code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="193">.jpg</code><span>).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Ouvrez le magasin dans le jeu :</b><span> Lancez la page,</span><span> cliquez sur le titre,</span><span> puis sur </span><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="79">MAGASIN</b><span> :</span><span> chaque rectangle d'arme doit afficher son visuel sans icône d'image cassée.</span></p></li></ol><blockquote dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Astuce d'organisation :</b> Si vous préférez ranger vos images dans un sous-dossier (par exemple <code data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="93">assets/armes/</code>), il faudra alors mettre à jour le chemin dans <code data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="154">script.js</code> (ex. <code data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="169">"assets/armes/image_c93845.png"</code>).</p></blockquote><div class="attachment-container unknown md-has-block-component"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><follow-up _nghost-ng-c2014533622="" class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2014533622="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="follow-up-container hide-from-message-actions"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2014533622="" class="follow-up-text gds-headline-s">Voulez-vous ranger les images dans un sous-dossier dédié ?</div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2014533622="" class="follow-up-button-container"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2014533622="" class="follow-up-button lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" jslog="270376;track:generic_click"><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2014533622="" fonticonname="prompt_suggestion" size="small" _nghost-ng-c2757884704=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2757884704="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-s lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="prompt_suggestion" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="prompt_suggestion"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><span _ngcontent-ng-c2014533622="" class="gds-body-m">Yes</span></button><!----><!----></div></div></follow-up><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---