----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_db0e8e31a200cc65" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_db0e8e31a200cc65" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">Parfait,</span><span> on garde intact tout ce qui fonctionne déjà (titre animé,</span><span> garage,</span><span> menu latéral,</span><span> magasin,</span><span> améliorations et choix de difficulté) et on ajoute </span><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="149">l'interface et les boutons de combat</b><span> au lancement d'une difficulté :</span></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Transition en 20 rectangles alternés</b><span> (rouge / vert) qui disparaissent un par un quand on choisit une difficulté.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">HUD de combat complet</b><span> :</span></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,1"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">En haut à gauche</b><span> :</span><span> bouton </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="26">STOP</b><span> (et touche </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="42">Échap</b><span> pour arrêter la partie).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">En haut au milieu</b><span> :</span><span> barre de progression sectionnée par vagues avec une </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="72">icône de boss</b><span> à la fin.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">En haut à droite</b><span> :</span><span> affichage en direct de l'argent gagné pendant la partie.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,1,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">En bas à gauche</b><span> :</span><span> cercle de déplacement avec </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="45">Z</b><span> en haut,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="56">S</b><span> en bas,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="66">Q</b><span> à gauche,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="78">D</b><span> à droite (cliquable et lié au clavier Z/Q/S/D).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,1,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">En bas à droite</b><span> :</span><span> boutons </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,4,0" data-index-in-node="26">RECHARGER</b><span>,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,4,0" data-index-in-node="37">TIRER</b><span>,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,4,0" data-index-in-node="44">CHANGER D'ARME</b><span> et </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,4,0" data-index-in-node="62">SOINS</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,1,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,1,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">Au centre</b><span> :</span><span> petit réticule / croix de visée (plus les contrôles de base souris/clic gauche/clic droit et l'aperçu bras + arme dans la scène de combat sans toucher au reste de votre menu).</span></p></li></ul></li></ul><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><span>Voici les mises à jour pour </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="28">index.html</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="40">style.css</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="53">script.js</code><span>.</span></p><h3 data-path-to-node="4" class=""><code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="0">index.html</code></h3><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 586ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-21 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-21 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9kYjBlOGUzMWEyMDBjYzY1IiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLCJyY19mNDMxMzc5MTRkNGMyOTJmIixudWxsLG51bGwsImZyIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ8QI" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2260553123-21"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2260553123-21"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2260553123-21 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcon