<gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" _nghost-ng-c2757884704=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2757884704="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted lm-icon-m" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="edit" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="edit"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><!----><!----><model-response _ngcontent-ng-c559760304="" _nghost-ng-c1028177799="" class="enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799=""><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c1361134428="" class="ng-tns-c1361134428-26 reduced-bottom-padding enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates enable-luminous-sources ng-star-inserted" jslog="188576;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80ZWQ1ZmUwOTY1ODE3YWI4IiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQoMELahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrgM"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container response-container-with-gpi ng-tns-c1361134428-26 no-background" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="1"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c1361134428-26 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c1361134428-26"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="ng-tns-c1361134428-26 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c1361134428-26"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c1361134428-26"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c1361134428-26"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c1361134428-26" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c1361134428-26"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1361134428-26"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c2236698117="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_4ed5fe0965817ab8" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_4ed5fe0965817ab8" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">Oui,</span><span> c'est tout à fait réalisable en HTML/CSS/JS :</span><span> on peut reproduire l'esprit des boutons circulaires translucides inspirés de l'image </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="136">image_f4670c.jpg</code><span> (avec icônes/symboles tactiques et anneaux semi-transparents) ainsi qu'une vue à la première personne montrant les bras et l'arme tenue à la manière de </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="305">image_f4670c.jpg</code><span> (tout en conservant vos images d'armes et votre logique existante).</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><span>Voici ce qui est mis à jour :</span></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Style FPS inspiré de <code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="21">image_f4670c.jpg</code></b><span> :</span><span> boutons d'action circulaires semi-transparents avec bordures et icônes stylisées (tir,</span><span> rechargement,</span><span> changement d'arme,</span><span> soins),</span><span> mains/bras à la première personne tenant l'arme,</span><span> tout en gardant le bouton </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="243">STOP</b><span>,</span><span> la </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="252">barre de progression des vagues + boss</b><span> et votre </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="300">aperçu de dégainage / tir / rechargement</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Cercle de déplacement (<code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="23">Z/Q/S/D</code>) recentré</b><span> :</span><span> rapproché vers le centre-gauche de l'écran (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="87">left: 18%</code><span> / </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="99">bottom: 24px</code><span>) plutôt que collé tout au bord gauche.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Gains uniquement sur élimination de zombie</b><span> :</span><span> tirer seul n'ajoute plus d'argent ; les gains augmentent uniquement quand un zombie est tué (avec une cible/zombie cliquable ou visable dans la zone de combat pour tester facilement).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Pause via STOP / Échap</b><span> :</span><span> appuyer sur </span><b data-path-to-node="2,3,0" data-index-in-node="37">STOP</b><span> ou </span><b data-path-to-node="2,3,0" data-index-in-node="45">Échap</b><span> met la partie en pause sans la quitter,</span><span> et affiche un panneau avec </span><b data-path-to-node="2,3,0" data-index-in-node="118">REPRENDRE LA PARTIE</b><span> et </span><b data-path-to-node="2,3,0" data-index-in-node="141">QUITTER LA PARTIE</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Menu latéral masqué pendant la partie</b><span> :</span><span> le menu (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,4,0" data-index-in-node="49" class="">#side-menu</code><span>) se cache dès le lancement de la partie et ne réapparaît qu'à la fin ou lorsqu'on quitte la partie.</span></p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="4" class=""><code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="0">index.html</code></h3><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 586ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-27 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-27 ng-animate-d