="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c1361134428-36"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1361134428-36"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c2236698117="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_3ff609a4cd136004" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_3ff609a4cd136004" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">Merci pour la capture </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="22">image_f4dfe8.jpg</code><span>,</span><span> elle montre exactement le rendu actuel du garage,</span><span> des boutons et du HUD.</span><span> Voici la mise à jour complète intégrant toutes vos demandes :</span></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Cercle de déplacement (<code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="23">Z/Q/S/D</code>)</b><span> :</span><span> recentré au milieu de la moitié gauche en bas (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="81">left: 25%</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,0,0" data-index-in-node="92">bottom: 24px</code><span>).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Boutons circulaires à droite</b><span> :</span><span> regroupés et centrés verticalement sur le bord droit (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="85">right: 28px</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="98">top: 50%</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="108">transform: translateY(-50%)</code><span>),</span><span> avec des </span><b data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="147">icônes agrandies</b><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,1,0" data-index-in-node="165">1.55rem</code><span>) et des boutons légèrement plus larges.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Munitions limitées + affichage en direct</b><span> :</span><span> chaque tir consomme 1 munition ; à </span><code data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="78">0</code><span> munition,</span><span> le tir est bloqué tant que vous ne rechargez pas (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="140">RELOAD</code><span>,</span><span> clic droit ou touche </span><code data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="169">R</code><span>),</span><span> et le compteur de munitions (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,2,0" data-index-in-node="202">munitions / max</code><span>) s'affiche clairement.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Barre de vie du joueur</b><span> :</span><span> placée juste en dessous de la zone entre le bouton </span><b data-path-to-node="1,3,0" data-index-in-node="76">STOP</b><span> et la barre de progression des vagues (et les soins </span><code data-path-to-node="1,3,0" data-index-in-node="133">SOINS</code><span> restaurent des PV).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="1,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Croix fixe supprimée + curseur souris en croix</b><span> :</span><span> la croix fixe au centre de l'écran est retirée,</span><span> et le curseur de la souris prend la forme d'une croix (</span><code data-path-to-node="1,4,0" data-index-in-node="152" class="">cursor: crosshair</code><span class="">) dans la zone de combat.</span></p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="3" class=""><code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">index.html</code></h3><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="--animation-duration: 715ms;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-37 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-37 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8zZmY2MDlhNGNkMTM2MDA0IiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLCJyY19hNjAwOGIxNWNkZWVjOGU4IixudWxsLG51bGwsImZyIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQoQQ" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2260553123-37"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2260553123-37"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block-decoration header-f