-c1361134428="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c1361134428-42" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c1361134428-42"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1361134428-42"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c2236698117="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_4ad61646e879d4f9" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_4ad61646e879d4f9" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">Bien vu sur la capture </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="23">image_f54122.jpg</code><span> :</span><span> le cercle </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="52">Z/Q/S/D</code><span> était trop bas/à gauche et les boutons d'action étaient centrés verticalement à droite au lieu d'être centrés dans le quart inférieur droit.</span></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><span>En découpant l'écran en </span><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="24">4 quadrants</b><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="37">50vw</code><span> de large et </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="54">50vh</code><span> de haut chacun) :</span></p><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Quadrant bas-gauche</b><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="21">left: 0</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">top: 50vh</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="41">width: 50vw</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="54">height: 50vh</code><span>) :</span><span> le cercle </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="80">Z/Q/S/D</code><span> est centré pile au milieu de ce carré (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="127">left: 50%</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="138">top: 50%</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="148">transform: translate(-50%, -50%)</code><span>).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Quadrant bas-droit</b><span> (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="20">left: 50vw</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="32">top: 50vh</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="43">width: 50vw</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="56">height: 50vh</code><span>) :</span><span> le groupe de boutons circulaires (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="106">ARME</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="112">SOINS</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="119">RELOAD</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="127">TIRER</code><span>) est centré pile au milieu de ce carré (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="173">left: 50%</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="184">top: 50%</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="194">transform: translate(-50%, -50%)</code><span>).</span></p></li></ul><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><span>Voici uniquement les modifications CSS nécessaires dans </span><code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="56">style.css</code><span> (les autres fichiers restent inchangés).</span></p><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4">Mise à jour de <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="15">style.css</code></h3><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5"><span>Remplacez les blocs </span><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="20">.move-circle</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="36">.fps-action-cluster</code><span> (ainsi que la partie </span><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="77">@media (max-width: 768px)</code><span> correspondante) par ceci :</span></p><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-43 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-43 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80YWQ2MTY0NmU4NzlkNGY5IiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLCJyY19kNDVhMjE5NjFmMmVlNGQwIixudWxsLG51bGwsImZyIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ2QQ" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2260553123-43"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2260553123-43"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2260553123-43 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-43">CSS</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2260553123-43 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c2260553123-43 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3971949594="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-45" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" _nghost-ng-c275788470