code> : le cercle <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="49">Z/Q/S/D</code> est encore en bas à gauche (<code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="85">left: 25%</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="96">bottom: 24px</code>) et les boutons d'action sont toujours collés tout à droite au milieu de la hauteur</span><span data-path-to-node="0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c4232265101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4232265101="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c775793796="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c775793796="" _nghost-ng-c2683803803="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from JPG: image_f5b63b.jpg. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ_QU"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">image_f5b63b.jpg</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1"><span>Pour que ça change vraiment à l'écran,</span><span> vérifiez deux choses :</span></p><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Sauvegarder <code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">style.css</code> + recharger sans cache</b><span> :</span><span> dans votre navigateur,</span><span> faites </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="77"><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="77">Ctrl + Shift + R</code></b><span> (ou </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="98"><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="98">Cmd + Shift + R</code></b><span>) après avoir enregistré le fichier </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="149">style.css</code><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Utiliser un sélecteur encore plus prioritaire (<code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="47">#combat-screen .move-circle</code> et <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="78">#combat-screen .fps-action-cluster</code>)</b><span> afin qu'aucune règle précédente ne prenne le dessus.</span></p></li></ol><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3"><span>Voici les blocs exacts à placer à la fin de votre </span><code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="50">style.css</code><span> (après avoir supprimé les anciens blocs </span><code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="100">.move-circle</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="116">.fps-action-cluster</code><span> plus haut dans le fichier) :</span></p><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-56 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-56 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80ZWIzMTYyZWE3NDJiZDBkIiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLCJyY18zMzdkNjA5ZWFlYTAzNGU1IixudWxsLG51bGwsImZyIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDAsMF1d" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ3AU" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2260553123-56"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2260553123-56"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2260553123-56 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-56">CSS</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2260553123-56 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c2260553123-56 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3971949594="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-45" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" _nghost-ng-c2757884704=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2757884704="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copy code" gemtooltip="Copy code" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2260553123-56 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3971949594="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-46" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" matbadgeposition="after" maticonbutton="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80ZWIzMTYyZWE3NDJiZDBkIiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLCJyY18zMzdkNjA5ZWFlYTAzNGU1IixudWxsLG51bGwsImZyIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutable:true" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" _nghost-ng-c2757884704=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2757884704="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span><span class="mat-ripple mat-mdc-button-ripple"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-56"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2260553123-56"><span class="hljs-comment">/* --- QUADRANTS DE CONTRÔLE (ÉCRAN DIVISÉ EN 4) --- */</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">/* Centre du cercle Z/Q/S/D dans le carré en bas à gauche (x: 25vw, y: 75vh) */</span>
<span class="hljs-selector-id">#combat-screen</span> <span class="hljs-selector-class">.move-circle</span> {
    <span class="hljs-attribute">position</span>: fixed;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">left</span>: <span class="hljs-number">25vw</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">top</span>: <span class="hljs-number">75vh</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">bottom</span>: auto;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">right</span>: auto;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">transform</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">translate</span>(-<span class="hljs-number">50%</span>, -<span class="hljs-number">50%</span>);
    <span class="hljs-attribute">z-index</span>: <span class="hljs-number">55</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">156px</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">156px</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">border-radius</span>: <span class="hljs-number">50%</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">background</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">15</span>, <span class="hljs-number">23</span>, <span class="hljs-number">30</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.45</span>);
    <span class="hljs-attribute">border</span>: <span class="hljs-number">2px</span> solid <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.35</span>);
    <span class="hljs-attribute">box-shadow</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span> <span class="hljs-number">20px</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.55</span>), inset <span class="hljs-number">0</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span> <span class="hljs-number">14px</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.08</span>);
}

<span class="hljs-selector-id">#combat-screen</span> <span class="hljs-selector-class">.move-center-stick</span> {
    <span class="hljs-attribute">position</span>: absolute;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">top</span>: <span class="hljs-number">50%</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">left</span>: <span class="hljs-number">50%</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">24px</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">24px</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">border-radius</span>: <span class="hljs-number">50%</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">background</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.25</span>);
    <span class="hljs-attribute">border</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1px</span> solid <span class="hljs-built_in">rgba</span>(<span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">255</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.5</span>);
    <span class="hljs-attribute">transform</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">translate</span>(-<span class="hljs-number">50%</span>, -<span class="hljs-number">50%</span>);
    <span class="hljs-attribute">pointer-events</span>: none;
}

<span class="hljs-comment">/* Centre des boutons d'action dans le carré en bas à droite (x: 75vw, y: 75vh) */</span>
<span class="hljs-selector-id">#combat-screen</span> <span class="hljs-selector-class">.fps-action-cluster</span> {
    <span class="hljs-attribute">position</span>: fixed;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">left</span>: <span class="hljs-number">75vw</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">top</span>: <span class="hljs-number">75vh</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">right</span>: auto;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">bottom</span>: auto;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">transform</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">translate</span>(-<span class="hljs-number">50%</span>, -<span class="hljs-number">50%</span>);
    <span class="hljs-attribute">z-index</span>: <span class="hljs-number">55</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">214px</span>;
    <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">214px</span>;
}

<span class="hljs-keyword">@media</span> (<span class="hljs-attribute">max-width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">768px</span>) {
    <span class="hljs-selector-id">#combat-screen</span> <span class="hljs-selector-class">.move-circle</span> {
        <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">132px</span>;
        <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">132px</span>;
    }
    <span class="hljs-selector-id">#combat-screen</span> <span class="hljs-selector-class">.move-key</span> {
        <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">34px</span>;
        <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">34px</span>;
        <span class="hljs-attribute">font-size</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0.88rem</span>;
    }
    <span class="hljs-selector-id">#combat-screen</span> <span class="hljs-selector-class">.fps-action-cluster</span> {
        <span class="hljs-attribute">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">184px</span>;
        <span class="hljs-attribute">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">184px</span>;
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5"><i data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">(Astuce : si vous voulez visualiser les 4 carrés pendant vos tests, vous pouvez ajouter temporairement <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="103">border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.2);</code> sur <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="149">#combat-view-layer</code> avec un dégradé de 4 zones, puis l'enlever une fois le centrage validé.)</i></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="6"><span>Est-ce que le bouton </span><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="21">STOP</b><span> ou le menu de pause fonctionne bien de votre côté,</span><span> ou voulez-vous qu'on vérifie un autre élément de l'écran ?</span></p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c3304081241="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c10