"" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_21d517afbbaac136" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token" id="p-rc_9051cb8f1d4a95f2-20"><span data-path-to-node="0,0" class="">Super, le centrage dans les deux carrés du bas rend beaucoup mieux sur <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="71">image_f5bcc6.jpg</code></span><span data-path-to-node="0,1" class=""><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c4232265101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4232265101="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2" class=""> ! Il ne reste plus qu'à agrandir légèrement le cercle de déplacement (<code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="71">Z/Q/S/D</code>), les boutons d'action (<code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="103">ARME</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="109">SOINS</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="116">RELOAD</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="124">TIRER</code>) et leurs icônes/textes pour qu'ils soient bien lisibles et confortables.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c775793796="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c775793796="" _nghost-ng-c2683803803="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from JPG: image_f5bcc6.jpg. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQvoAQahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpgY"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c2683803803="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">image_f5bcc6.jpg</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1" style="--animation-duration: 466ms;"><span class="">Voici les blocs CSS à mettre à jour dans </span><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="41" class="">style.css</code><span class=""> :</span></p><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-60 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-60 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8yMWQ1MTdhZmJiYWFjMTM2IiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLCJyY185MDUxY2I4Z