</div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_3c588872bd5afe89" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_3c588872bd5afe89" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0" class="">Oui, exactement !</b><span class=""> Vous collez ce bloc JavaScript </span><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="49">à la toute fin de votre <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="73">script.js</code></b><span>,</span><span> après la partie qui gère </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="109">money</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="116">weapons</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="125">difficulties</code><span>,</span><span> le magasin,</span><span> les améliorations et les 5 difficultés.</span></p><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1">Deux petites vérifications importantes pour que ça fonctionne sans conflit :</h3><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Évitez les doublons</b><span> :</span><span> si vous aviez déjà une section </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="53">// --- TRANSITION 20 RECTANGLES, COMBAT &amp; PAUSE / ZOMBIES ---</code><span> plus haut dans </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="130">script.js</code><span>,</span><span> </span><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="141">supprimez l'ancienne</b><span> avant de coller la nouvelle à la fin (sinon </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="206">let inCombat</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="220">let isPaused</code><span>,</span><span> etc.</span><span> seront déclarés deux fois et bloqueront le script).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Vérifiez l'ordre dans <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="22">index.html</code></b><span> :</span><span> assurez-vous que </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="52">three.min.js</code><span> est placé </span><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="75">avant</b><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="81">script.js</code><span> :</span></p></li></ol><response-element class="no-md md-has-block-component" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2260553123="" class="ng-tns-c2260553123-78 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2260553123-78 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8zYzU4ODg3MmJkNWFmZTg5IiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLCJyY185MDlmODVjMzZjY2FiOTNiIixudWxsLG51bGwsImZyIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d" style="display: block;" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsgc"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2260553123="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c226