</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="6">Rappel rapide pour <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="19">style.css</code> et <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="32">script.js</code></h3><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">style.css</code></b><span> :</span><span> ne doit contenir </span><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="29">que</b><span> du CSS (enlevez toute ligne </span><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="61">const ...</code><span> ou </span><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="74">let ...</code><span> qui aurait glissé dedans,</span><span> et gardez bien </span><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="123">#combat-screen .move-circle</code><span> à </span><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="153">left: calc(25vw - 40px)</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="180">#combat-screen .fps-action-cluster</code><span> à </span><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="217">left: calc(75vw + 40px)</code><span>).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">script.js</code></b><span> :</span><span> ne doit contenir </span><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="29">que</b><span class=""> du JavaScript (enlevez tout code HTML ou CSS qui s'y trouverait,</span><span> et gardez une seule fois chaque variable comme </span><code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="145">title</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="152">inCombat</code><span>,</span><span> </span><code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="162">isPaused</code><span>).</span></p></li></ul><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="8"><span>Si vous voulez,</span><span> collez ici vos fichiers </span><code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="40">style.css</code><span> et </span><code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="53">script.js</code><span> séparément (ou dites-moi ce qu'affiche la console </span><code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="113">F12</code><span>) et je vous les nettoie directement.</span></p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></model-response-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c3304081241="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c2433247864="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c861928794="" class="ng-star-inse