at-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-controls="user-query-content-16" aria-label="Edit" jslog="173924;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl85NzFjNzk0NTE4MTEyNjdiIiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==" aria-disabled="false"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3971949594="" _nghost-ng-c2757884704=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2757884704="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted lm-icon-m" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="edit" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="edit"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><!----><!----><model-response _ngcontent-ng-c559760304="" _nghost-ng-c1028177799="" class="enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799=""><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c1361134428="" class="ng-tns-c1361134428-87 reduced-bottom-padding enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates enable-luminous-sources ng-star-inserted" jslog="188576;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl85NzFjNzk0NTE4MTEyNjdiIiwiY18xNjNhNjhlNzE2NWIxMDY2IixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQoMELahgKEwj-nfCQlZiYAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQjgg"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container response-container-with-gpi ng-tns-c1361134428-87 no-background" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="1"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c1361134428-87 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c1361134428-87"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="ng-tns-c1361134428-87 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c1361134428-87"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c1361134428-87"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c1361134428-87"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c1361134428-87" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1361134428="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c1361134428-87"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1361134428-87"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c2236698117="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h6><!----><!----></div><!----><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1028177799="" _nghost-ng-c39557751=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" collapsibleresponsecontent="" class="collapsible-content-wrapper"><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c39557751="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1506435711="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c1506435711="" _nghost-ng-c1845261516="" id="message-content-id-r_971c79451811267b" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1845261516="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_971c79451811267b" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="0" class="first-token"><span class="">Si même le titre d'accueil (</span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="28" class="">GaRaGe DeS EnFeRs</code><span>) ne réagit plus au clic,</span><span> c'est presque toujours qu'une </span><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="101">erreur JavaScript</b><span> bloque l'exécution du fichier </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="149">script.js</code><span> (souvent un doublon de variable comme </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="197">const title</code><span> ou </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="212">let inCombat</code><span>,</span><span> ou du texte/CSS qui s'est glissé dedans).</span></p><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="1">1. Vérifiez l'erreur exacte en 10 secondes</h3><ol start="1" dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><span>Ouvrez votre page dans le navigateur.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><span>Appuyez sur </span><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="12"><code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="12">F12</code></b><span> (ou clic droit -&gt; </span><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="34">Inspecter</b><span>),</span><span> puis allez dans l'onglet </span><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="71">Console</b><span>.</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><span>S'il y a une ligne en rouge (</span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="29">Uncaught SyntaxError: ...</code><span> ou </span><code data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="58">Identifier '...' has already been declared</code><span>),</span><span> c'est elle qui bloque tout le reste du script.</span></p></li></ol><h3 dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="3">2. Faites un test minimal pour isoler le problème</h3><ul dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Si même le clic sur le titre ne fait rien</b><span> :</span><span> le problème est au début de </span><code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="72">script.js</code><span> (doublon ou faute de frappe).</span></p></li><li><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Si le titre et le menu marchent, mais que l'écran 3D plante au lancement de la partie</b><span> :</span><span> la ligne </span><code data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="97">[https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.min.js](https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.min.js)</code><span> n'a peut-être pas pu charger (connexion coupée ou bloqueur),</span><span> ou </span><code data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="266">initThreeFPS()</code><span> a rencontré une erreur.</span></p></li></ul><p dir="ltr" data-path-to-node="5"><span>Envoyez-moi ce que vous voyez dans la </span><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="38">Console (F12)</b><span> ou collez ici votre </span><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="72">script.js</code><span> et votre </span><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="91">style.css</code><span> actuels — je vous les remettrai d'aplomb immédiatement.</span></p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----></div></structured-content-container><!